1587380/extras/c44fde6a339def49cad3ae2f6b6743ea.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/e8178695bc3a9c7cffd54a205eef80ae.poster.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/e8178695bc3a9c7cffd54a205eef80ae.webm?t=1762225566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/e8178695bc3a9c7cffd54a205eef80ae.mp4?t=1762225566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/f66a8845f704895dff014f797ff5dfbf.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><strong>1\ufe0f\u20e3 There's a Solid Two Hours of gameplay in the demo, more if you want to collect all items, mp3s, and goodies.</strong><br><br><strong>2\ufe0f\u20e3 There is also a clearly defined beginning/middle/end to the demo experience. You can &quot;beat it&quot;. Treat this demo <i>as a game</i>.</strong><br><br><strong>3\ufe0f\u20e3 The platforming will become difficult as you progress, though never unfair. </strong><br><br><strong>4\ufe0f\u20e3 This is a somewhat precise platformer, playing with a controller is recommended, though not required.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/7247fc4cf7d0b9eb08621d986738fd48.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/9793b47b61afc46a0d78c841c749316d.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND POWER-UPS &amp; COLLECTABLES</h2><br>The world of Little Ghost and the game's art style present really fun and unique opportunities for hiding easter-eggs and collectables.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/1764843b5273a01d92932dd5ab51044d.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=407 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/f090fbe6f7f0f1def73a5099b026b434.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>There are 3 types of collectables: Items, Mp3s, and Tarot Cards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2>One of the demo quests has you searching for scattered mp3s, which you can listen to on your in-game music player. <br>(The mp3 player is a little Penguin by the way; he's great, we love him.)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/4c32b4c906016be1ba86289bc362e35b.avif?t=1762225566\" width=135 height=140 /></span><br>His collectable playlist features <strong>music from:</strong> GULL, It's Not Night It's Space, miRthkon, Nehedar, Christopher North, Pattern Recognition, Andras Jones, The Donkeys, and Jesse Miller, as well as <strong>podcasts from:</strong> 42Minutes, Radio8Ball, Always Record, and Fine Just Fine.<br><i>Streamers have our permission to broadcast the Little Ghost music &amp; podcasts on their streams and playthrus.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR PLAYABLE CHARACTERS (Full Game Only)</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/6925061001d4a61f0650e4a8bfa5f8ad.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Each member of your party handles differently - movement speed &amp; jump heights vary<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/45279ad5a090a54de5bfd52d6d9c070d.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming to Kickstarter October 2022</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/c01ade0ed33904161036f3cd1bf60edb.webp?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=35 /></span><br><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Retro-inspired Platforming<br><br>\ud83c\udf38 Explore A Breathtaking Surreal Paper World<br><br>\ud83d\udc7e Full Of Secret Hidden Spaces<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/cfd58bc4ef18513fd7933b2f580c0261.poster.avif?t=1762225566\" width=600 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/cfd58bc4ef18513fd7933b2f580c0261.webm?t=1762225566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/extras/cfd58bc4ef18513fd7933b2f580c0261.mp4?t=1762225566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1587380?t=1762225566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762225566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762225566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762225566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cursing & Strong language 